From 656202422ed06dcec8661c4b6e0382b15dd0521d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Khem Raj <khem.raj@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 07:52:38 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Use pre-fetched git dependencies

Point the git dependencies (the influxdata forks of arrow-datafusion
and arrow-rs-object-store, and datafusion-udf-wasm) at local checkouts
fetched by the build system, and drop their git sources from Cargo.lock
so that cargo can build offline with --frozen.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [oe specific]
AI-Generated: Uses Claude Code
Signed-off-by: Khem Raj <khem.raj@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
 Cargo.lock | 37 -------------------------------------
 Cargo.toml | 18 +++++++++---------
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 46 deletions(-)

